          "portableImportReload": true,
          "scene": "The first page\nNorthern rests his page on the park bench. ‘I thought I needed a proper room before I could begin.’\nNorthern reads: ‘There was a town where nobody asked what you had finished. They asked what you had begun.’ His hands stop shaking halfway through.\nSub: ‘Two listeners count. A first page does not need a grand opening.’\nThey pass round Baba's bread tray. Your coins have become something shared."
        },
        {
